+# Intake reports (generated)
+
+Running `bun run strategies:intake` or `bun run strategies:report` writes:
+
+- `intake-report.md` — human-readable report.
+- `intake-report.json` — machine-readable report.
+
+These files are generated and gitignored. Re-run the command to refresh them.
